# CODEOWNERS for Construction AI OS
#
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-security/managing-other-settings/about-code-owners
#
# Scope: legal, security, compliance, and CI release paths
# require explicit approval from the repository owner. The
# account @abdelnabym519-cpu is the formal owner; branch
# protection on main should require Code Owner review for any
# file matched here.
#
# This distribution replaced the upstream owner account with this
# repository's owner. @datadrivenconstruction has no access to this
# fork, so a Code Owner review naming that account could never be
# given, and branch protection requiring one would have blocked every
# pull request touching a matched path. Upstream's first-party author
# policy is a separate concern: .github/workflows/authors-guard.yml
# applies only when the repository IS the upstream project, and says
# why it does not apply here when it is not.

